      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW LONDON (1) stalked the lead after a clean break from the tricky draw and went on to finish third (23.57) at Horsham in a Grade 5 over 410m. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Capable of going well again. LEKTRA HOPPER (4) turned in a better run last time to find a minor placing (18.33) at this track behind Cadillac Landau in a Other. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Hard to beat again. COMPTON BOWIE (8) is worth forgiving last start after finishing sixth (24.00) from Box 2 at this track over 400m. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from four starts. Deserves plenty of respect. ASTON RAMONA (7) was in the money last start at this track and distance - poses a threat again.",
